      "structure_description": "Compound 1 is a discrete, centrosymmetric, ribbon-shaped polyoxometalate octamer approximately 6.1 nm long. Eight Eu2W2-substituted Dawson-type selenotungstate units form sandwich-type dimers, which assemble into two tetramers; citrate ligands and Co2+ centers connect the hierarchical units into the octamer. The EuW-1 and EuW-2 citrate-bridged units have distinct ligand coordination modes.",
